  "describe": "Revenue this month $1,284,530 in 40 dp with a green up arrow and +4.2%; under it Costs 48 210,75 € with a red up arrow and +3.1% (invert), and Active users 2.5M end-aligned with a red down arrow and −1.4%. revenueChange −3 turns the first change red with a down arrow and −3.0%; 0 shows a muted flat arrow and 0.0%. Mono: the same arrows and signs in white (black on mono-light). At 240 dp the values shrink to fit their tiles; at 520 dp the end-aligned one follows the edge. A screen reader hears three items: \"Revenue this month, $1,284,530, up 4.2 percent\", \"Costs, 48 210,75 €, up 3.1 percent\", \"Active users, 2,480,000, down 1.4 percent\".",
